  "about": "Well known MCP servers and connectors the assistant may install by name. kind: plugin (a Claude Code plugin from the official marketplace, which brings the MCP server with its OAuth client), http or sse (a remote MCP server), stdio (a local command), connector (a claude.ai connector, enabled on the web for the whole Claude login). auth: oauth (a browser sign in after install), token (needs an API token from the user, as an env var), none. Check endpoints with each provider when in doubt.",
